{
  "id": "zhou-flat",
  "name": "The twins' place",
  "description": "Silas and Ember Zhou's place on Level 2 of the Ribbon, behind the stickered door down Hicks's walkway: one main room split down the middle. Her half: a heaped bed under a wall of band posters and fairy lights, a winged star among them, and her rig of mismatched old screens on milk crates around a stickered deck. Between them, a patched couch Hicks has slept on, under a barred window onto the girders and somebody else's neon, and a table buried in takeout, cans and cable. His half: a workbench under a magnifier lamp, parts drawers, a shelf with a boxy CRT playing an old detective show, Halloran-style holovid posters and a photo of their mother's repair stall. Through a doorway, a cramped kitchen with a kettle, an open fridge and a lantern. The front door is stickered and tagged on the inside too.",
